stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Launched: アプリ起動
    Launched --> NotLoggedIn: セッションなし
    Launched --> Foreground: セッション復元成功
    NotLoggedIn --> Foreground: ログイン成功
    Foreground --> Foreground: BLE scan advertise 継続
    Foreground --> Background: paused inactive hidden
    Background --> Foreground: resumed
    Foreground --> Terminated: detached
    Background --> Terminated: OS により kill
    Terminated --> [*]: BLE 完全停止
    Foreground --> NotLoggedIn: ログアウト
